# LF in the repository and in the checkout, on every platform.
#
# This is not only tidiness. The portfolio's drift test re-cuts the seven marked passages from
# the live essay and compares them byte-for-byte against `fixtures/passages/`. If Git rewrote
# line endings on checkout, that comparison would fail on Windows and pass on Linux, and a test
# whose result depends on the developer's operating system is not evidence of anything.
* text=auto eol=lf
